1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,585
What if an older adult slips at home or feels sudden chest pain?

2
00:00:04,585 --> 00:00:09,817
In the upper corner of the senior screen, there is a dedicated red 'SOS' button.

3
00:00:09,817 --> 00:00:15,965
The senior doesn't need to unlock their phone, open contacts, or search through phone numbers.

4
00:00:15,965 --> 00:00:23,486
Holding the SOS button for three seconds immediately places a direct phone call to their primary emergency contact.

5
00:00:23,486 --> 00:00:33,296
At the same time, top-priority alert notifications are sent to all designated family members, putting help just seconds away when every second counts.
